+{
+ "nbformat": 4,
+ "nbformat_minor": 5,
+ "cells": [
+  {
+   "cell_type": "markdown",
+   "metadata": {},
+   "source": [
+    "# 🛰️ 衛星データ解析（Python実装）練習ノートブック\n",
+    "スマートパン屋農家「探究コーナー：衛星データ解析」と同じ計算を、自分の手で動かします。\n",
+    "\n",
+    "**3段構え**：① 現象を計算する → ② 数値を可視化する → ③ 自分の条件で判断する\n",
+    "\n",
+    "- 1〜5 節は **架空の地図**（三原の小麦畑と川沿いを想定。実測ではありません）で、ネットがなくても最後まで動きます。\n",
+    "- 6 節は任意：ネットにつながる環境で、Sentinel-2 の無料公開データを読み込む例です。\n",
+    "- 下敷き：『SAR衛星データ解析入門』（講談社）・『Pythonで学ぶ衛星データ解析基礎』。コードは独自のもので、書籍の転載ではありません。"
+   ]
+  },
+  {
+   "cell_type": "code",
+   "metadata": {},
+   "execution_count": null,
+   "outputs": [],
+   "source": [
+    "# 0. 準備：リポジトリの計算部品（satellite_lab.py）を使えるようにする\n",
+    "import os, sys\n",
+    "if not os.path.exists(\"satellite_lab.py\"):\n",
+    "    if not os.path.exists(\"Smart-Bakery-Farmer_20260923\"):\n",
+    "        os.system(\"git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/nayukaya3-cn/Smart-Bakery-Farmer_20260923.git\")\n",
+    "    sys.path.insert(0, \"Smart-Bakery-Farmer_20260923\")\n",
+    "import numpy as np\n",
+    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
+    "import satellite_lab as sl\n",
+    "plt.rcParams[\"figure.dpi\"] = 110\n",
+    "sc = sl.make_scene(seed=0, cloud_cover=0.25, flood_m=1.5)\n",
+    "print(\"地図の大きさ:\", sc.cls.shape, \"／ 1画素 =\", sl.PIXEL_HA, \"ha\")"
+   ]
+  },
+  {
+   "cell_type": "markdown",
+   "metadata": {},
+   "source": [
+    "## 1. 光学：バンド演算で NDVI を計算する\n",
+    "植物の葉は赤い光を吸い、近赤外をよく反射します。NDVI = (近赤外 − 赤) / (近赤外 + 赤)。"
+   ]
+  },
+  {
+   "cell_type": "code",
+   "metadata": {},
+   "execution_count": null,
+   "outputs": [],
+   "source": [
+    "red, nir = sc.optical[2], sc.optical[3]\n",
+    "nd = sl.ndvi(red, nir)\n",
+    "true_color = np.clip(np.stack([sc.optical[2], sc.optical[1], sc.optical[0]], -1) * 3.5, 0, 1)\n",
+    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(9, 4))\n",
+    "ax[0].imshow(true_color); ax[0].set_title(\"true color\")\n",
+    "im = ax[1].imshow(nd, cmap=\"RdYlGn\", vmin=-0.5, vmax=0.9); ax[1].set_title(\"NDVI\")\n",
+    "plt.colorbar(im, ax=ax[1]); [a.axis(\"off\") for a in ax]; plt.show()\n",
+    "for c, name in enumerate(sl.CLASSES):\n",
+    "    m = (sc.cls == c) & ~sc.cloud\n",
+    "    print(f\"{name:6s} NDVI平均 {nd[m].mean():+.2f}\")\n",
+    "print(\"雲の画素の NDVI 平均:\", round(float(nd[sc.cloud].mean()), 2), \"← 雲を『植物がない』と読まない\")"
+   ]
+  },
+  {
+   "cell_type": "markdown",
+   "metadata": {},
+   "source": [
+    "## 2. SAR：dB・スペックル・Lee フィルタ・大津の方法で水域"
+   ]
+  },
+  {
+   "cell_type": "code",
+   "metadata": {},
+   "execution_count": null,
+   "outputs": [],
+   "source": [
+    "raw_db = sl.to_db(sc.sar_before)\n",
+    "filt_db = sl.to_db(sl.lee_filter(sc.sar_before, r=2, looks=sc.looks))\n",
+    "thr = sl.water_threshold(filt_db)   # 大津の方法を2段階で\n",
+    "print(f\"水の閾値（自動）: {thr:.1f} dB\")\n",
+    "truth = sc.cls == sl.WATER\n",
+    "for name, img in [(\"生のまま\", raw_db), (\"ならした後\", filt_db)]:\n",
+    "    s = sl.scores(truth, img < thr)\n",
+    "    print(f\"{name}: F1={s['F1']:.2f} 誤報={s['誤報']} 見逃し={s['見逃し']}\")\n",
+    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(1, 3, figsize=(12, 4))\n",
+    "ax[0].imshow(raw_db, cmap=\"gray\", vmin=-28, vmax=2); ax[0].set_title(\"raw (dB)\")\n",
+    "ax[1].imshow(filt_db, cmap=\"gray\", vmin=-28, vmax=2); ax[1].set_title(\"Lee filter\")\n",
+    "ax[2].hist(filt_db.ravel(), bins=120); ax[2].axvline(thr, color=\"r\"); ax[2].set_title(\"histogram\")\n",
+    "[a.axis(\"off\") for a in ax[:2]]; plt.show()"
+   ]
+  },
+  {
+   "cell_type": "markdown",
+   "metadata": {},
+   "source": [
+    "## 3. 変化を見つける：大雨の前後の差で「新しく浸水した所」\n",
+    "③ 判断：自分の圃場（オレンジの枠）が何％浸かったら行動するかを、自分で決めます。"
+   ]
+  },
+  {
+   "cell_type": "code",
+   "metadata": {},
+   "execution_count": null,
+   "outputs": [],
+   "source": [
+    "diff, flooded = sl.change_map(sc.sar_before, sc.sar_after, thr_drop_db=3, water_thr_db=thr, looks=sc.looks)\n",
+    "print(\"前後の差:\", {k: round(v, 2) for k, v in sl.scores(sc.flood, flooded).items() if k in (\"再現率\", \"適合率\", \"F1\")})\n",
+    "print(\"後の1枚だけ:\", {k: round(v, 2) for k, v in sl.scores(sc.flood, sl.water_map(sc.sar_after, thr)).items() if k in (\"再現率\", \"適合率\", \"F1\")})\n",
+    "mine = sl.crop(flooded, sc.my_field)\n",
+    "ACTION_PERCENT = 10   # ← 自分の基準に変える\n",
+    "print(f\"わたしの圃場：{mine.size * sl.PIXEL_HA:.2f} ha のうち {mine.mean():.0%} が浸水と判定\")\n",
+    "print(\"判定:\", \"行動する\" if mine.mean() * 100 >= ACTION_PERCENT else \"見守る\")\n",
+    "r0, r1, c0, c1 = sc.my_field\n",
+    "plt.imshow(diff, cmap=\"RdBu\", vmin=-12, vmax=12)\n",
+    "plt.gca().add_patch(plt.Rectangle((c0 - .5, r0 - .5), c1 - c0, r1 - r0, fill=False, color=\"orange\", lw=2))\n",
+    "plt.title(\"after - before (dB)\"); plt.colorbar(); plt.axis(\"off\"); plt.show()\n",
+    "# 水位を変えて、自分の圃場の「デッドライン」を探す\n",
+    "for m in [1.0, 1.5, 2.0, 2.5, 3.0]:\n",
+    "    s2 = sl.make_scene(0, flood_m=m)\n",
+    "    print(f\"水位 +{m} m → 圃場の浸水 {sl.crop(s2.flood, s2.my_field).mean():.0%}\")"
